WEBVTT

00:15.932 --> 00:17.934
[opening theme music playing]

00:40.248 --> 00:44.961
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

00:45.670 --> 00:46.504
Please tell me.

00:48.006 --> 00:49.174
What do I have inside my body?

00:50.633 --> 00:51.593
I'd like to know…

00:54.095 --> 00:55.138
before I die soon.

01:01.478 --> 01:03.938
[Seo Yul] When I fell unconscious
after having been seriously injured,

01:04.689 --> 01:07.108
they told me that
you gave me some of your blood.

01:07.192 --> 01:08.651
[So-i breathes shakily]

01:09.861 --> 01:10.737
Didn't you?

01:11.988 --> 01:13.156
I only did it to save you.

01:13.740 --> 01:16.326
Because I thought the energy of
the blood parasite would keep you alive.

01:16.910 --> 01:17.786
Parasite?

01:22.582 --> 01:25.251
So inside me… was a parasite.

01:25.335 --> 01:27.378
They told me that
you'd be fine with the medicine.

01:27.462 --> 01:28.797
That's why I've been sending it to you.

01:29.547 --> 01:30.757
You never took them?

01:35.386 --> 01:36.221
Why?

01:39.891 --> 01:41.351
It's because you could not trust…

01:43.061 --> 01:45.271
something that came from a girl like me…

01:47.065 --> 01:47.899
Young Master?

01:55.406 --> 01:56.658
[So-i grunts]

01:58.618 --> 01:59.661
Put it back in me.

02:00.787 --> 02:02.747
Put that parasite inside you
back in me right now.

02:05.667 --> 02:07.210
- I said put it in me--
- Stop moving!

02:07.877 --> 02:08.711
This cut is deep.

02:13.049 --> 02:14.342
You are so reckless.

02:20.515 --> 02:22.892
Even someone like myself
was able to cut it out.

02:24.144 --> 02:25.687
So how come you can't remove it?

02:25.770 --> 02:28.106
The moment it entered
my energy-filled body,

02:29.899 --> 02:31.109
it entered the core of my energy.

02:32.360 --> 02:33.695
The parasite has settled there

02:33.778 --> 02:36.114
and it's currently eating away
every bit of my energy.

02:38.241 --> 02:39.075
[sighs]

02:39.159 --> 02:40.785
I will die the moment
that it's all been consumed.

02:42.120 --> 02:43.830
[gasps]
I'm sure there must be a way.

02:43.913 --> 02:46.374
Jin U-tak was the one
who put that parasite inside of me,

02:46.457 --> 02:47.959
so it must be a Jinyowon relic.

02:48.585 --> 02:50.712
There must be a way
to get rid of it there.

02:53.423 --> 02:57.218
Was the one who gave you the medicine
Gwanju Jin Mu of Cheonbugwan?

03:03.766 --> 03:06.060
Then he must have told you
to spread rumors about…

03:07.645 --> 03:08.813
how Naksu's come back to life.

03:12.400 --> 03:14.736
Does he also know
that the blood parasite is now in my body?

03:17.780 --> 03:18.740
No one else knows.

03:23.369 --> 03:25.079
There's no need to send medicine anymore.

03:25.663 --> 03:27.040
Nor will I come see you again.

03:30.001 --> 03:32.170
I came here
for the last time to sort things out.

03:33.046 --> 03:34.923
Please continue to keep this a secret.

03:43.097 --> 03:44.557
You're about to die all because of me

03:45.183 --> 03:46.434
so why are you letting me go?

03:47.727 --> 03:49.354
Shouldn't you want to kill me?

03:54.567 --> 03:56.319
I believe that
you only did this to save me.

03:57.487 --> 03:58.321
Am I right?

04:07.080 --> 04:09.499
[sobs]

04:09.582 --> 04:11.709
[Cho-yeon]
Maidservant Kim gave this to me.

04:11.793 --> 04:14.379
These diamonds are
very rare and precious, aren't they?

04:15.755 --> 04:17.173
Are you giving them back to me then?

04:19.133 --> 04:21.469
- Take them, please.
- I knew you'd reject me.

04:23.221 --> 04:24.055
I understand.

04:29.769 --> 04:31.479
Why are you trembling like that?

04:36.067 --> 04:37.235
For the past three years…

04:40.196 --> 04:41.906
I've been dreading that a moment…

04:43.157 --> 04:44.200
like this would come.

04:46.577 --> 04:49.205
[sobs]
I would tear up just thinking about it.

04:51.541 --> 04:52.625
Now that it's here…

04:55.003 --> 04:56.963
it's simply unbearable.

04:57.964 --> 04:59.340
So that was the thought

05:00.174 --> 05:02.468
that's been on your mind
for these past years.

05:08.433 --> 05:09.767
Then see for yourself

05:10.518 --> 05:12.186
what these three years were like for me.

05:22.113 --> 05:22.947
This is…

05:24.282 --> 05:26.409
the charm that brings lovers together.

05:27.952 --> 05:29.912
Have you kept it this entire time though?

05:31.414 --> 05:33.374
Not even for a second did I believe you

05:34.083 --> 05:36.002
would simply forget
what I've meant to you…

05:38.588 --> 05:40.006
unless I abandoned you.

05:41.632 --> 05:42.467
So then…

05:43.593 --> 05:46.137
is the reason you're showing me this…

05:49.057 --> 05:51.517
to let me know that
you actually didn't throw it away…

05:52.727 --> 05:54.020
and kept it all this time?

05:54.103 --> 05:55.938
Otherwise, I would have tossed it.

05:56.689 --> 05:58.024
Why else would I show it to you?

05:58.608 --> 05:59.525
Oh.

06:02.153 --> 06:02.987
Thank you for this.

06:05.156 --> 06:07.492
Just knowing you didn't throw it away…

06:09.118 --> 06:10.161
gives me some relief.

06:11.287 --> 06:13.498
I'm thankful
for the present that you sent.

06:18.044 --> 06:20.588
But right now, I don't think
I can wear it in public yet.

06:22.799 --> 06:23.716
That's more than fine.

06:24.801 --> 06:26.302
But you should still hold on to it.

06:26.385 --> 06:28.137
It is a present after all.

06:30.515 --> 06:33.559
It'd be a waste to… just to keep it.

06:33.643 --> 06:37.063
Uh, so how about you wear it
at least for a moment then?

06:38.606 --> 06:40.650
[soft music playing]

06:59.418 --> 07:00.253
How is it?

07:01.462 --> 07:02.505
Do I look pretty?

07:06.968 --> 07:07.969
Yeah.

07:10.805 --> 07:12.890
You're absolutely
the most beautiful woman…

07:14.642 --> 07:15.685
in the world.

07:15.768 --> 07:16.644
[chuckles]

07:30.450 --> 07:32.743
Thank you for this, for your help now.

07:32.827 --> 07:35.121
I also was hoping that this would make

07:35.204 --> 07:38.082
people stop talking
about that woman Naksu.

07:38.166 --> 07:43.588
With this, Uk has finally erased Naksu
from this world once and for all.

07:43.671 --> 07:47.341
I only hope he's erased her
from his heart as well.

07:48.926 --> 07:51.762
Naksu was Jang Uk's true love.
Everyone knows that.

07:51.846 --> 07:56.517
I understand why you are not happy
to welcome Uk as your son-in-law.

07:58.144 --> 08:00.730
Why would that insufferable man
want to take Bu-yeon?

08:00.813 --> 08:04.650
I understand that Bu-yeon needed him
to escape being Jinyowon's heir.

08:04.734 --> 08:08.112
What I don't get is why
he wanted to marry her in the first place.

08:08.196 --> 08:11.949
Bu-yeon is a priestess
with the power to see energy.

08:12.533 --> 08:15.912
I heard that she recognized
with just a single glance at him…

08:17.246 --> 08:20.208
the ice stone
and the energy of the sky within it.

08:21.250 --> 08:23.836
The energy of… the sky?

08:25.254 --> 08:27.089
She said that
it was her job to protect him.

08:29.300 --> 08:32.011
I hope they'll be able

08:33.137 --> 08:35.556
to keep each other out of harm's way.

08:42.688 --> 08:45.024
[soft music playing]

09:43.833 --> 09:45.501
I guess you are still dreaming.

09:48.170 --> 09:49.088
That's a shame.

10:04.145 --> 10:05.605
I'm not dreaming anymore.

10:07.189 --> 10:08.024
So…

10:09.942 --> 10:11.110
do you know who I am then?

10:11.193 --> 10:12.320
Yeah.

10:13.362 --> 10:14.322
You're the one who woke me up.

10:21.120 --> 10:22.413
[groans softly]

10:23.789 --> 10:25.291
I didn't mean to wake you.

10:25.374 --> 10:27.460
You got drunk
and mistook me for someone else.

10:27.543 --> 10:30.421
The only reason I stayed was
because I couldn't leave you like that.

10:31.047 --> 10:33.215
I thought you were still asleep though.

10:33.299 --> 10:35.301
Then let's just pretend
I never woke up and…

10:36.052 --> 10:37.303
leave so I can go back to bed.

10:37.386 --> 10:38.763
That's the best I've slept…

10:40.181 --> 10:41.557
in what seems like forever, you know.

10:45.394 --> 10:46.896
Actually, I'm the one
you should thank for that.

10:46.979 --> 10:49.065
You are the one
who woke me up from my deep sleep.

10:49.148 --> 10:50.107
[gasps softly]

10:51.651 --> 10:53.319
Can't you feel
how the energy's changed in here?

10:53.402 --> 10:55.821
The wraiths have all
fled this place because I'm here.

10:55.905 --> 10:57.698
See? It's not cold anymore.

11:04.789 --> 11:06.082
So if I leave,

11:06.874 --> 11:08.584
I doubt you'll be able
to sleep like you were.

11:12.254 --> 11:13.506
- Should I…
- Okay then…

11:15.633 --> 11:16.676
stay here.

11:19.637 --> 11:21.639
I mean both you and I are
in need of some rest.

11:23.099 --> 11:26.060
So sleep here
and try not to wake me again.

11:30.606 --> 11:31.440
Fine.

11:32.191 --> 11:33.025
I guess so.

11:34.860 --> 11:38.697
Since helping you sleep better
is a way you can use me.

11:50.042 --> 11:52.002
I heard it's hard for you to sleep
because of the ice stone.

11:54.255 --> 11:55.756
Isn't that why you brought me here?

11:56.715 --> 11:57.758
To help you sleep?

11:59.468 --> 12:00.302
Yeah.

12:01.887 --> 12:03.055
That's why I brought you here.

12:04.473 --> 12:05.975
So I can fall into a deep sleep.

12:11.397 --> 12:13.649
Uk, has falling asleep been…

12:14.733 --> 12:16.277
truly that difficult for you?

12:19.697 --> 12:21.073
I'm sorry I woke you up.

12:24.034 --> 12:26.162
Should I pat your back again
so you can sleep?

12:30.583 --> 12:31.417
Wh-What?

12:31.500 --> 12:34.253
One of the reasons you slept so well
was because I patted you.

12:34.795 --> 12:36.672
I did it until my wrist hurt, you know.

12:37.923 --> 12:38.841
Should I do it?

12:38.924 --> 12:41.343
[stutters] It's fine. You…

12:43.762 --> 12:45.723
This here… Don't cross this line.

12:46.474 --> 12:48.476
["Breath" by Kim Na Young playing]

13:23.636 --> 13:24.845
See, it's warm.

13:26.764 --> 13:27.598
Yeah.

13:30.226 --> 13:31.185
It is warm.

14:04.468 --> 14:07.388
For letting Jang Uk stay
in Jeongjingak with the ice stone,

14:07.471 --> 14:12.017
the pupils from the other mage families
have all decided to leave this place.

14:12.101 --> 14:15.396
My former master, Master Seo Gyeong,
established Jeongjingak

14:15.479 --> 14:17.231
and now it lies empty.

14:17.314 --> 14:21.527
Master, they're… they're all envious
because Songrim now has the ice stone

14:21.610 --> 14:22.861
so they are trying to exclude us.

14:22.945 --> 14:27.366
Having Jang Uk with us means
our power hasn't diminished one bit.

14:27.449 --> 14:30.578
Even though it's been three years,
I see you haven't matured one bit, Yeom.

14:30.661 --> 14:31.954
- Hmm?
- Master Seo Gyeong

14:32.037 --> 14:35.457
didn't build Jeongjingak hoping to see
which mage was the strongest,

14:35.541 --> 14:37.543
but rather to unify and educate the world.

14:37.626 --> 14:39.378
- Yes.
- [Jin] I apologize, Master Lee.

14:39.461 --> 14:42.464
I have failed to honor his late wishes.

14:43.007 --> 14:44.592
Jin, you tried your best.

14:45.342 --> 14:47.261
You put your life
on the line to protect Jang Uk

14:47.344 --> 14:50.055
and pacified the complaints
from all the other mages.

14:50.723 --> 14:52.975
You even retired at such a young age.

14:55.769 --> 14:58.898
You always favor Jin over me, Master.

15:01.650 --> 15:02.484
[sighs]

15:02.568 --> 15:07.156
I heard that you had treated
Jin Bu-yeon when she was very ill.

15:07.239 --> 15:09.491
[Heo Yeom] Mm, remember what she said?

15:09.575 --> 15:13.245
She was treated by the one
who is the best physician in Daeho.

15:13.329 --> 15:17.833
And that physician was our dear master.
[giggles]

15:17.917 --> 15:21.545
Lady Jin had begged me to keep
her daughter's treatment a secret.

15:21.629 --> 15:24.256
Now that she's married to Jang Uk
and is revealed to the world,

15:24.340 --> 15:25.758
there's nothing to hide.

15:25.841 --> 15:28.427
Uk, that rascal,
he must have also been the one

15:28.510 --> 15:30.304
who kidnapped her on her wedding day.

15:30.387 --> 15:33.390
Right? He just declared
they were married like that.

15:33.474 --> 15:35.809
He threw
the Unanimous Assembly into chaos.

15:37.019 --> 15:38.062
[clicks tongue]

15:39.688 --> 15:40.522
[Master Lee sighs]

15:41.732 --> 15:43.400
So I guess this is fate then.

15:44.860 --> 15:45.694
Something…

15:46.654 --> 15:48.113
humans cannot control.

15:57.122 --> 15:57.998
[Jang Uk] It is warm.

15:58.791 --> 15:59.959
Please keep going.

16:22.356 --> 16:23.357
[Bu-yeon] What was that?

16:23.941 --> 16:25.359
That didn't happen last night.

16:31.991 --> 16:33.909
Was that another one
of her memories as well?

16:37.162 --> 16:38.038
[groans softly]

16:46.338 --> 16:47.172
[Jang Uk] Master,

16:47.798 --> 16:48.924
I finally did it.

16:49.008 --> 16:50.843
I missed you too. That's my response.

16:50.926 --> 16:52.386
Try to look pretty for your Young Master?

17:03.147 --> 17:04.440
[Mu-deok] Young Master.

17:04.523 --> 17:05.399
[Bu-yeon groans]

17:05.482 --> 17:06.316
Young Master.

17:06.942 --> 17:08.068
Young Master.

17:09.236 --> 17:10.279
Young Master.

17:24.043 --> 17:25.753
[Seo Yul]
The soul shifter you killed yesterday

17:26.420 --> 17:27.421
wasn't Naksu, was it?

17:27.504 --> 17:30.007
The rumor that's been
going around everywhere made it seem true.

17:30.090 --> 17:31.592
So now, that name won't be a problem.

17:32.926 --> 17:33.969
It will not appear ever again.

17:34.053 --> 17:35.971
Jin Mu was the one who spread that rumor.

17:37.639 --> 17:38.640
I know.

17:42.102 --> 17:43.312
So you had already suspected him.

17:44.813 --> 17:45.814
[sighs]

17:48.025 --> 17:49.109
Due to this incident,

17:50.027 --> 17:52.071
this is the first time
we've actually talked about her.

17:59.411 --> 18:00.245
Uk, she…

18:02.748 --> 18:04.374
she sometimes comes to me in my dreams.

18:08.962 --> 18:11.715
Some nights, though, I have dreams
that she stabs me with a sword.

18:12.508 --> 18:13.509
And other nights…

18:16.470 --> 18:18.097
I dream I'm the one who stabs her.

18:21.308 --> 18:23.352
I believe it has to be
due to the guilt I feel

18:24.770 --> 18:26.355
for running away like I did.

18:32.694 --> 18:34.279
She's just as rude as she was alive!

18:34.822 --> 18:36.740
Why would she torment you
in your dreams when…

18:37.658 --> 18:38.742
you did nothing wrong?

18:44.081 --> 18:44.915
Yul.

18:46.458 --> 18:48.752
From the moment
I first saw those eyes of hers,

18:49.753 --> 18:50.963
it was my responsibility.

18:51.046 --> 18:52.214
So you…

18:53.340 --> 18:54.842
shouldn't feel so guilty about it.

18:55.843 --> 18:56.885
It's not like you ran away.

18:58.887 --> 19:00.472
I appreciate you saying that.

19:02.266 --> 19:04.226
If only I'd recognized her before you did,

19:05.477 --> 19:07.396
I would've also taken
responsibility for everything.

19:08.397 --> 19:09.231
[sighs]

19:09.314 --> 19:11.984
[Jin] Hey, Uk, Yul, come and eat.

19:12.067 --> 19:14.319
So you can be responsible
for eating the breakfast.

19:14.403 --> 19:17.698
I had to eat 100 of his dumplings
and there's still about 50 left.

19:18.240 --> 19:19.241
So good luck!

19:19.950 --> 19:21.785
What? Just eat ten of them.

19:23.829 --> 19:24.663
[Seo Yul clears throat]

19:25.164 --> 19:27.082
You're on your own. It's up to you.

19:28.083 --> 19:30.043
- I have somewhere to go now.
- Go where?

19:30.127 --> 19:31.128
The palace.

19:32.004 --> 19:33.380
The people who spread that rumor…

19:34.339 --> 19:35.716
should take responsibility as well.

19:39.094 --> 19:40.345
[servants murmuring]

19:40.429 --> 19:41.763
[Maid Kim] Did you search everywhere?

19:42.806 --> 19:44.099
Then where could she be?

19:45.142 --> 19:47.102
Come on, let's go search
every inch of this place again.

19:47.186 --> 19:48.562
- [servant 1] Right, sir.
- [servant 2] Come on.

19:52.024 --> 19:54.109
- What's going on?
- Young Lady Bu-yeon is gone.

19:55.027 --> 19:57.529
Her head hurt
so I thought she was resting.

19:58.113 --> 19:59.198
But I can't find her though.

20:00.282 --> 20:01.950
- She was feeling ill?
- Yeah.

20:02.034 --> 20:05.370
Strangely enough, everyone says
they slept very well last night

20:05.454 --> 20:06.872
because the house felt warm.

20:06.955 --> 20:08.415
But somehow she didn't.

20:11.293 --> 20:13.462
The wraiths have all fled
this place because I'm here.

20:14.046 --> 20:15.964
See? It's not cold anymore.

20:17.341 --> 20:19.801
Bu-yeon drove the wraiths away.

20:21.428 --> 20:22.971
Did she really do so?

20:23.055 --> 20:23.931
Yeah.

20:24.723 --> 20:29.144
Ah, so that means
she took in all that cold energy?

20:30.020 --> 20:31.188
Maybe that's why.

20:31.855 --> 20:33.482
But where would she go if she was sick?

20:33.565 --> 20:34.983
Do you know where she would go?

20:35.067 --> 20:36.360
How would I know about that?

20:36.443 --> 20:38.862
Really? So you have no idea then?

20:38.946 --> 20:41.365
- I don't.
- Well, makes sense.

20:41.990 --> 20:45.285
I've never seen the pair of you
eat or even go out together.

20:45.869 --> 20:47.746
How would an absent husband know that?

20:48.372 --> 20:49.206
Forget it then.

20:50.040 --> 20:51.416
[sighs] She's not here.

20:55.420 --> 20:56.421
She's feeling ill?

20:59.216 --> 21:00.467
Did only I sleep well?

21:05.681 --> 21:06.515
[sighs]

21:13.063 --> 21:14.106
[grunts]

21:15.857 --> 21:16.900
That bastard!

21:16.984 --> 21:19.069
Argh! That jerkface!

21:21.280 --> 21:22.447
Where could she have gone though?

21:23.824 --> 21:26.451
[indistinct chatter]

21:28.662 --> 21:29.621
[sighs]

21:32.374 --> 21:34.084
I don't really know anything about her…

21:35.419 --> 21:36.837
so I don't even know where to start.

21:40.173 --> 21:41.633
Should I try Jinyowon?

21:49.766 --> 21:51.101
[biscuit seller] Gosh, back so soon?

21:52.227 --> 21:54.813
I'll have the usual
and some honey biscuits too.

21:54.896 --> 21:55.897
[biscuit seller] Of course.

21:56.732 --> 21:58.734
[whimsical music playing]

22:04.156 --> 22:06.575
[fan seller]
Goodness, aren't you a beautiful girl!

22:06.658 --> 22:08.910
We have so many pretty choices.
Please take a look.

22:14.291 --> 22:15.334
How much is this one?

22:15.417 --> 22:16.918
It's only five nyang.

22:18.086 --> 22:19.046
That's too much!

22:19.129 --> 22:22.132
[fan seller] What? No, it's not.
I'm practically giving it away to you.

22:22.716 --> 22:23.800
Three nyang. Nothing less.

22:23.884 --> 22:25.052
- Three nyang?
- [fan seller] Mm.

22:25.135 --> 22:26.636
But you're robbing me blind.

22:26.720 --> 22:27.554
Three nyang?

22:27.637 --> 22:28.680
- Yeah.
- Okay.

22:29.264 --> 22:30.098
[scoffs]

22:30.766 --> 22:31.641
[woman] Oh, you bastard…

22:31.725 --> 22:33.894
[fan seller] Oh, gosh, looks like
those two are fighting again.

22:33.977 --> 22:35.437
- Anyway, here you are.
- Thank you, Miss.

22:35.520 --> 22:36.772
[woman] Who were you with last night, huh?

22:36.855 --> 22:39.191
What were you doing? You were not here!

22:39.274 --> 22:42.069
I fell asleep. You know I was drunk.

22:42.152 --> 22:43.445
Who do you take me for?

22:43.528 --> 22:46.073
You were with those widows,
weren't you? Why, you bastard!

22:46.156 --> 22:48.241
- [man] Let go of me! Just let go!
- [woman] I wish you'd die!

22:48.325 --> 22:49.993
- [man grunts]
- [woman] You're such a scumbag!

22:50.077 --> 22:51.078
What's going on here?

22:51.161 --> 22:53.330
She says her husband never sleeps at home.

22:53.413 --> 22:55.165
[man] That's not what happened!
You got it all wrong!

22:55.248 --> 22:56.792
Oh, the wife must be very upset then.

22:56.875 --> 23:00.295
- [man] I'm telling you that's not…
- Rumor is he's seeing a widow.

23:00.378 --> 23:02.422
[woman] You've been running around?
Stop trying to run away!

23:02.506 --> 23:03.590
Tell me the truth.

23:04.591 --> 23:07.260
- Who were you with last night?
- [man] Come on, woman! Let go!

23:07.344 --> 23:08.720
[woman yelling]

23:11.515 --> 23:12.599
Jang Uk.

23:13.892 --> 23:17.104
Apparently, that man was having an affair
with the woman at the oil shop.

23:17.687 --> 23:19.272
That's why he never returned home.

23:19.773 --> 23:21.149
Her husband's problematic, huh?

23:23.318 --> 23:26.446
Are you comparing me
to the man from the rice store?

23:26.530 --> 23:29.074
I did feel satisfied
watching that man getting his hair pulled.

23:29.157 --> 23:29.991
[Jang Uk scoffs]

23:31.201 --> 23:33.286
But why are you here now?

23:33.370 --> 23:35.831
I heard you're sick,
but you seem all right.

23:35.914 --> 23:37.332
Fine enough to pull my hair right now.

23:37.916 --> 23:40.127
You were looking for me
because you were worried?

23:41.962 --> 23:43.964
I came to find you
because no one knew where you were.

23:44.589 --> 23:46.675
I need you now. We have somewhere to be.

23:47.259 --> 23:48.218
I knew it.

23:48.885 --> 23:50.011
Where do we have to go?

23:57.269 --> 24:00.147
I heard that your head hurt.
But you're neither hot nor cold.

24:00.939 --> 24:01.773
Oh.

24:02.607 --> 24:04.985
I was a bit dizzy.

24:06.194 --> 24:08.363
I thought it'd get worse
if I stayed in the house.

24:08.446 --> 24:09.865
Say something if you're sick.

24:10.448 --> 24:11.491
We were worried about you.

24:11.575 --> 24:13.577
I know everyone over at the house

24:13.660 --> 24:16.037
would have been more than happy
to take care of you if you needed it.

24:19.624 --> 24:20.458
You too?

24:23.420 --> 24:24.546
I'm here, aren't I?

24:30.093 --> 24:31.887
Let's go. It's hot.

24:34.264 --> 24:35.724
Uk, doesn't that fan feel nice?

24:36.224 --> 24:37.809
- I got a good deal on it.
- [sighs]

24:37.893 --> 24:40.103
That woman ripped you off.
You paid double its worth.

24:40.187 --> 24:43.064
[Bu-yeon] Really? She said
she was selling it for nothing.

24:43.690 --> 24:45.442
- Give it then.
- [Jang Uk] Hey, come on now.

24:46.067 --> 24:46.985
[Eunuch Oh] Sire.

24:47.777 --> 24:48.612
Come on in.

24:50.030 --> 24:53.158
This turtle, please leave it
at Chwiseonru for the next few days.

24:53.241 --> 24:55.452
The change in environment
might shock it, so be sure

24:55.535 --> 24:56.995
to move its entire enclosure there.

24:57.537 --> 24:59.456
And make sure they don't overfeed it.

24:59.539 --> 25:01.166
Got it? Ah!

25:01.708 --> 25:04.544
And don't tell them I sent the turtle,
just tell them that it comes from you.

25:04.628 --> 25:07.464
But why… why do you
bring them there so suddenly?

25:07.547 --> 25:10.175
I was thinking that I would show
some kindness to the poor Turtle Shaman

25:10.258 --> 25:12.010
who's lost her husband to a peacock.

25:12.802 --> 25:14.262
I'll do as you say, Your Highness.

25:14.804 --> 25:15.639
Oh, by the way,

25:16.223 --> 25:18.850
I heard that Jang Uk and Jin Bu-yeon
are at the palace right now.

25:19.476 --> 25:20.310
Why are they here?

25:20.393 --> 25:22.687
Apparently, they've come to apologize
for ruining the Queen's banquet

25:22.771 --> 25:24.898
- the other day.
- Jang Uk's here to apologize?

25:26.274 --> 25:28.276
- He can do that?
- [Eunuch Oh] Will you go and see them?

25:28.360 --> 25:30.403
Jin Bu-yeon was someone
I knew you wanted to meet.

25:30.487 --> 25:31.529
Forget it.

25:31.613 --> 25:33.531
Just go and get some people
to move the turtle.

25:34.407 --> 25:35.575
Yes, Your Highness.

25:37.285 --> 25:38.161
[sighs]

25:39.579 --> 25:42.415
I'm the one who is responsible
for splitting Filthy Mu-deok and Jang Uk

25:42.499 --> 25:43.375
so he'd be alone.

25:45.794 --> 25:47.087
After doing what I'd done,

25:48.088 --> 25:50.340
I can't bear to see
Jin Bu-yeon in her place.

25:52.217 --> 25:53.385
[Bu-yeon] If we're here to apologize,

25:53.468 --> 25:55.220
I can just get on my knees and beg, right?

25:55.804 --> 25:57.055
[Jang Uk] We're not here to apologize.

25:57.847 --> 25:59.891
- [Bu-yeon] What?
- [Jang Uk] We're here to taunt them.

25:59.975 --> 26:01.977
They tried to take something
that was mine,

26:02.894 --> 26:04.729
so I've come here
to remind them that it's mine.

26:05.272 --> 26:06.106
What was it though?

26:11.069 --> 26:11.903
You.

26:17.826 --> 26:19.494
Don't you dare
get on your knees now and beg.

26:20.537 --> 26:24.040
Only keep your eyes on me
as if you're madly in love, okay?

26:31.548 --> 26:35.093
It was you two
who were in danger at my banquet.

26:35.927 --> 26:37.554
You don't need to apologize for that.

26:37.637 --> 26:40.307
No, my Queen.
I'm sorry that I brought Gwiseo.

26:40.390 --> 26:42.225
Especially when you haven't held
a banquet in years.

26:42.976 --> 26:44.102
But you see,

26:44.894 --> 26:47.188
this woman is so precious to me.
I had no choice

26:47.939 --> 26:49.607
other than replacing Bu-yeon with a relic

26:49.691 --> 26:52.319
out of fear that she could have
possibly been harmed at the banquet.

26:55.280 --> 26:57.741
I heard you two got married
without permission.

26:58.283 --> 27:00.076
But you two seem very in love.

27:00.994 --> 27:02.662
I feel that
she'll approve of us soon though.

27:03.288 --> 27:06.249
Could anyone else but myself
protect her daughter and Jinyowon?

27:06.333 --> 27:08.918
The way you speak is
as if Jinyowon is yours.

27:09.002 --> 27:10.295
It's because there are simply…

27:12.005 --> 27:14.007
too many who act as if
they have the power to take it.

27:15.800 --> 27:16.718
Jinyowon will…

27:17.677 --> 27:19.012
be protected as if it were mine.

27:24.184 --> 27:25.560
For this person right here.

27:26.686 --> 27:28.688
[quirky music playing]

27:29.689 --> 27:30.732
Bu-yeon, when I grab your hand,

27:31.316 --> 27:32.984
come up with a reasonable excuse to leave.

27:34.069 --> 27:35.528
- Just me?
- Yes.

27:35.612 --> 27:37.447
That's all that I need you to do in there.

27:38.073 --> 27:39.240
Remember what I said, okay?

27:40.200 --> 27:41.326
A reasonable excuse.

27:44.746 --> 27:46.039
[screams]
It's a bee!

27:46.122 --> 27:48.291
I'm sorry. I'm just so terrified of bees.

27:52.337 --> 27:53.296
[chuckle awkwardly]

27:53.380 --> 27:55.048
She's just so terrified of them

27:55.131 --> 27:57.133
since they always tend
to swarm her sweetness.

27:58.009 --> 27:59.094
[laughs]

27:59.844 --> 28:02.389
I thought she was just
a confident girl when I first saw her.

28:03.098 --> 28:04.516
I guess she's rude too.

28:05.183 --> 28:07.060
That's part of her charm, isn't it?

28:07.143 --> 28:10.105
Always surpassing all expectations,
tends to keep me on my toes.

28:10.188 --> 28:13.024
You have gained a wife, Jinyowon,

28:13.108 --> 28:16.027
and even the power of the ice stone.
How greedy can you get?

28:16.111 --> 28:18.113
I'd love to use that power
in any way I please.

28:18.613 --> 28:21.699
But as you may know, I'm only
allowed to use it to catch soul shifters.

28:24.035 --> 28:25.161
It's such a shame!

28:25.829 --> 28:29.707
My powers would have been able to
make your deepest desires become reality.

28:31.668 --> 28:32.502
Right.

28:32.585 --> 28:36.548
With the power of Hwansu,
you could shift my soul with another.

28:38.675 --> 28:40.343
If you can help me with this,

28:40.427 --> 28:42.929
I would have no need to summon
another ice stone from the sky.

28:43.012 --> 28:46.349
How would you be able to
summon another ice stone though?

28:46.433 --> 28:48.768
I was told it's possible
by drying out the world.

28:48.852 --> 28:49.894
Ah.

28:50.979 --> 28:53.148
So the reason
you wanted to control Jinyowon

28:53.940 --> 28:56.067
was to find a relic to dry out the world.

28:56.151 --> 28:57.527
I finally understand it now.

28:58.111 --> 29:01.698
I knew you were trying to keep me occupied
by summoning Naksu to our world.

29:02.282 --> 29:04.909
What I could not understand is why

29:05.410 --> 29:07.704
you would go so far as to hurt
Jin Bu-yeon to take Jinyowon.

29:07.787 --> 29:08.621
Jang Uk.

29:10.457 --> 29:12.417
Shift my soul using your powers now.

29:13.251 --> 29:16.755
Do that, and I'll have no interest
in drying out this entire world.

29:18.256 --> 29:19.090
[scoffs]

29:21.050 --> 29:23.470
I, too, couldn't care less
if this world dries out.

29:23.553 --> 29:25.305
But if you ever touch Bu-yeon again,

29:25.930 --> 29:26.765
then you'll…

29:27.432 --> 29:29.934
see me use the power
that's inside me any way I want.

29:37.942 --> 29:39.861
Please relay this message with anyone else

29:40.820 --> 29:43.114
who's been scheming with you as well.

29:47.535 --> 29:49.537
[tense music playing]

30:18.316 --> 30:20.652
[Go Won] And with this incident,
Jang Uk and I have become

30:20.735 --> 30:22.362
even clearer enemies to each other.

30:23.112 --> 30:27.408
Your Highness. Gwanju Jin Mu asked you
to come to Cheonbugwan as soon as you can.

30:27.492 --> 30:29.702
He's asking me to go there
instead of coming here

30:30.411 --> 30:31.538
in order to meet with me?

30:31.621 --> 30:34.332
He said it was regarding the promise
he made you the last time you met.

30:35.250 --> 30:39.754
[Jin Mu] The first thing I plan to do
is bring Jinyowon to the royal family.

30:40.380 --> 30:42.507
I'm doing all of this for you, Sire.

30:44.092 --> 30:46.427
I decided to keep Jin Mu
by my side to beat Jang Uk.

30:46.511 --> 30:49.430
But now somehow it seems that
I'm the one being used by Jin Mu.

30:55.979 --> 30:57.772
[Eunuch Oh]
Are you heading to Cheonbugwan then?

30:57.856 --> 31:00.692
No. I would like to see Jang Uk's bride.

31:05.363 --> 31:07.740
[Bu-yeon] It seems like
he was going to talk about Jinyowon.

31:08.408 --> 31:09.576
So why did he make me leave?

31:10.451 --> 31:11.369
Odd!

31:21.546 --> 31:23.548
[eunuch] Be careful with the turtle
so you don't startle it.

31:24.424 --> 31:25.758
Slowly, slowly.

31:28.803 --> 31:29.637
Pardon.

31:30.179 --> 31:33.308
Does that turtle belong to Eunuch Go
who works in the palace?

31:33.391 --> 31:35.226
It's the eunuch
who works for the Crown Prince.

31:35.310 --> 31:36.477
Ah!

31:37.186 --> 31:38.730
I don't think we have a Eunuch Go here.

31:38.813 --> 31:40.440
He must be Eunuch Oh then.

31:41.858 --> 31:44.068
- Ah, Eunuch Oh.
- Yeah.

31:44.152 --> 31:45.737
Then I must have heard him wrong.

31:46.613 --> 31:49.699
But we are moving the turtle
under Eunuch Oh's instructions.

31:50.283 --> 31:51.659
- You are?
- Yes.

31:55.538 --> 31:57.957
So that really is you.
[laughs]

31:58.041 --> 31:59.751
Your life sure is nice at the palace.

32:00.335 --> 32:02.629
- Set it down for a moment.
- [chuckles]

32:03.504 --> 32:05.465
I just wanted to say hi since I know it.

32:05.548 --> 32:06.382
Sure.

32:07.425 --> 32:08.343
Oh, wow!

32:09.177 --> 32:10.219
Have you been doing well?

32:10.303 --> 32:12.680
- [eunuch] It seems like it recognizes you.
- [Bu-yeon chuckles]

32:22.982 --> 32:24.776
The water's clean but it's a bit cold.

32:25.944 --> 32:26.778
Are you okay?

32:46.172 --> 32:47.924
[eunuch] Gosh, that must
have been so tough for you.

32:50.009 --> 32:50.885
Your Highness.

32:56.391 --> 32:57.892
Did anyone change its water?

32:57.976 --> 32:59.894
Even a turtle could
get sick if it's too cold.

32:59.978 --> 33:02.730
Worry not, Young Master Jang Uk
also thought it was cold

33:02.814 --> 33:05.441
so he warmed it by using his energy, Sire.

33:06.025 --> 33:07.527
Jang Uk really took care of my turtle?

33:09.821 --> 33:11.280
- Did he know it was mine though?
- [eunuch] Yes.

33:11.364 --> 33:14.158
I told him Eunuch Oh
had ordered it to be moved.

33:14.993 --> 33:17.870
So he warmed the water with his energy
despite knowing it was my turtle.

33:17.954 --> 33:19.163
Sire.

33:19.247 --> 33:22.291
Jang Uk then must not
really feel that hostile towards you.

33:22.375 --> 33:26.129
Otherwise, why would he bother
to take care of your turtle at all?

33:26.212 --> 33:27.046
You're right.

33:28.297 --> 33:30.091
He would hate
my turtle as well if he hated me.

33:30.174 --> 33:32.010
- Where is Uk?
- Where is Uk?

33:32.093 --> 33:32.969
Where…

33:33.720 --> 33:36.681
Oh, uh, well, Jang Uk just
left here with his betrothed.

33:38.975 --> 33:41.644
Huh! Hmm, all right then. You may go now.

33:42.228 --> 33:43.062
Come on.

33:47.942 --> 33:49.402
Jang Uk took care of my turtle?

33:50.987 --> 33:53.531
So what am I supposed to make of all this?

33:54.907 --> 33:56.242
[Eunuch Oh] Huh…

33:57.160 --> 33:58.161
Huh?

34:03.666 --> 34:05.418
I'm certain he despises me.

34:06.544 --> 34:07.712
So why did he do that?

34:13.718 --> 34:14.802
[Jang Uk's hands swoosh]

34:16.554 --> 34:19.015
[in childlike voice]
I only did it because it was your turtle.

34:19.849 --> 34:20.683
Exactly.

34:21.934 --> 34:25.605
It's my turtle, but why would you
take care of it? Why?

34:25.688 --> 34:27.023
[in normal voice]
It's because that turtle was yours.

34:28.941 --> 34:29.984
But I thought you despise me.

34:30.068 --> 34:32.862
So why would you warm up
my turtle with your energy for no reason?

34:32.945 --> 34:34.155
Still not getting it?

34:35.406 --> 34:36.741
It's because that turtle was yours.

34:40.870 --> 34:41.704
Jang Uk.

34:42.997 --> 34:45.208
Tell me why on earth
did you take care of my turtle?

34:45.833 --> 34:46.876
If you do this…

34:48.503 --> 34:50.671
you're only giving me hope
that you don't actually hate me…

34:52.173 --> 34:53.382
as much as I thought.

34:56.886 --> 34:58.596
Thank you for helping take care of it.

34:59.347 --> 35:00.765
The eunuch sure will be pleased.

35:05.353 --> 35:07.355
So, when exactly
did you befriend a eunuch?

35:08.106 --> 35:09.232
We just met by chance.

35:09.315 --> 35:11.692
He's a kind man who saved
the turtle just because I asked him to.

35:11.776 --> 35:12.777
Oh.

35:13.611 --> 35:15.613
So you saved a turtle, made a friend,

35:15.696 --> 35:17.323
even watched a couple get into a fight.

35:18.199 --> 35:19.033
Sounds like fun.

35:20.201 --> 35:21.828
All thanks to my husband for saving me.

35:22.787 --> 35:23.621
[scoffs]

35:26.040 --> 35:26.874
Jang Uk.

35:31.254 --> 35:32.255
I heard that…

35:33.548 --> 35:34.882
you destroyed the tracking thread.

35:40.429 --> 35:41.264
Thanks for that.

35:42.598 --> 35:44.433
I told you I get worried if you get hurt.

35:45.143 --> 35:45.977
And I…

35:46.727 --> 35:48.646
thought you'd return home
if it kept hurting.

35:48.729 --> 35:50.481
I promise you I'll never go back there.

35:56.904 --> 36:00.241
I'm always going to stay
by your side at this distance.

36:14.672 --> 36:15.631
That's a promise.

36:25.141 --> 36:28.186
You are the one that
I'll be wearing for the rest of my life.

36:34.108 --> 36:34.942
[Jang Uk gasps]

36:49.040 --> 36:50.041
Jang Uk.

36:52.293 --> 36:53.252
Let me explain.

36:54.670 --> 36:58.090
When I had woken up this morning,
I saw even more memories.

36:59.800 --> 37:01.677
Also vivid as if they were really mine.

37:04.722 --> 37:06.307
It was really overwhelming.

37:06.390 --> 37:07.225
And so what?

37:08.267 --> 37:10.978
Did you grab my hand to remind me
of something you knew I couldn't forget?

37:11.854 --> 37:13.189
So I could happily reminisce?

37:13.272 --> 37:15.316
Last night, you got to cry
as much as you'd like.

37:17.193 --> 37:18.444
Didn't you feel better…

37:20.279 --> 37:21.155
after you let it out?

37:22.740 --> 37:23.574
Yeah, I guess I did.

37:25.326 --> 37:26.577
Then I suppose…

37:27.578 --> 37:29.455
I've found yet another use
that you have for me.

37:31.624 --> 37:33.376
I can grab your hand or embrace you

37:33.918 --> 37:35.169
if I feel like I miss her.

37:35.753 --> 37:39.006
Or fall asleep with you in my arms so
I don't have to wait for her in my dreams.

37:40.424 --> 37:41.717
Since you're offering…

37:43.594 --> 37:44.845
to be her real-life substitute.

37:51.519 --> 37:53.062
Feel free to recreate another one.

37:54.438 --> 37:55.273
And this time,

37:56.732 --> 37:58.192
I promise I won't push you away again.

37:59.235 --> 38:00.069
Last night…

38:03.239 --> 38:04.573
I was trying to comfort you.

38:07.493 --> 38:08.953
Because you just seemed so sad.

38:13.332 --> 38:14.166
And today,

38:16.043 --> 38:17.211
I was trying to find out…

38:19.547 --> 38:21.132
if there was any room in there for me.

38:24.885 --> 38:26.429
It seems there isn't, so I'll just go.

38:36.689 --> 38:37.606
[sighs]

38:43.321 --> 38:46.365
Did something bad happen
while you were at the palace?

38:48.451 --> 38:49.285
Nothing. No.

38:51.287 --> 38:53.164
Maidservant Kim, please give me your hand.

38:53.789 --> 38:55.082
- My hand?
- Mm.

38:55.166 --> 38:56.000
Here.

39:07.720 --> 39:09.597
And you are very precious as well.

39:09.680 --> 39:11.057
Oh, same here.

39:11.557 --> 39:13.517
[quirky music playing]

39:15.978 --> 39:18.022
Yeah, it should've felt more
like it did just now.

39:20.941 --> 39:22.360
[Jang Uk] But it felt so similar.

39:22.985 --> 39:23.819
[Maid Kim] What did?

39:24.862 --> 39:25.696
Oh, nothing.

39:27.740 --> 39:30.534
What did you say now
for her to cry like that?

39:30.618 --> 39:32.912
- She cried?
- No, but of course she was about to.

39:33.913 --> 39:35.539
What did you say this time to her?

39:35.623 --> 39:38.542
I don't know. I was just babbling
like a fool. She had surprised me, I--

39:38.626 --> 39:39.877
My goodness.

39:39.960 --> 39:42.213
I could put you over my knee
and spank you like a child.

39:42.296 --> 39:43.672
Here.

39:44.215 --> 39:47.426
Well, in any case,
at least you two are arguing

39:47.510 --> 39:49.178
and not just ignoring each other.

39:51.389 --> 39:54.350
But if you keep mistreating her this way,

39:54.433 --> 39:56.352
- you'll become a lost dog.
- Dog?

39:57.603 --> 39:59.855
Maidservant Kim,
did you call me a dog just now?

39:59.939 --> 40:01.357
Dear, did that hurt you?

40:01.440 --> 40:06.112
She's probably upset you thought
she's a chicken and not a pheasant, hmm.

40:06.195 --> 40:08.030
Can't deal with you two. Huh.

40:09.448 --> 40:11.784
[imitates dog barking]

40:14.453 --> 40:15.538
[Maid Kim grunts]

40:18.749 --> 40:19.583
[sighs]

40:27.258 --> 40:28.134
[sighs]

40:32.096 --> 40:33.681
Is it because of this jade?

40:34.473 --> 40:36.475
[pensive music playing]

40:53.993 --> 40:54.910
About what I said before,

40:56.662 --> 40:58.706
I didn't mean to imply
you were a chicken instead of a pheasant.

41:00.082 --> 41:02.585
It's not like I thought you were that,
but you were acting like one

41:02.668 --> 41:04.336
so that's the reason
why I lashed out at you.

41:07.882 --> 41:08.716
So please,

41:09.550 --> 41:10.885
don't ever act like a chicken.

41:12.094 --> 41:13.471
And I won't act like a dog either.

41:21.479 --> 41:22.688
[exhales]

41:23.272 --> 41:24.815
So what did he say now?

41:24.899 --> 41:25.858
Did you reconcile?

41:25.941 --> 41:26.901
I don't really know.

41:27.485 --> 41:29.320
He said I was a chicken and he was a dog.

41:36.076 --> 41:39.288
Hey, was he joking or looking for a fight?

41:40.456 --> 41:41.540
I can't…

41:42.333 --> 41:44.919
[Jin] Master Lee found
several of these sculptures

41:45.002 --> 41:47.338
at the bottoms of dried-up wells
in multiple villages.

41:47.421 --> 41:49.340
This is unspeakable sorcery.

41:49.423 --> 41:53.052
Someone has dried up the wells
intentionally out of pure hatred.

41:53.135 --> 41:57.640
The shamans sell things like these
at Gaema Village, don't they?

41:58.724 --> 41:59.892
It looks like a bird.

41:59.975 --> 42:01.644
[Jin] The drought has yet to relent.

42:01.727 --> 42:04.355
So if all of the drinking wells dry up,
there will be unrest.

42:05.731 --> 42:10.027
It troubles me that
they were found in several wells now.

42:11.612 --> 42:13.906
Hey, Dang-gu,
use the merchants' association

42:13.989 --> 42:16.116
to find out if any other wells
in the capital have dried up.

42:16.909 --> 42:17.910
Yes.

42:18.536 --> 42:20.329
Shouldn't Master Lee be here with us?

42:20.412 --> 42:23.582
He went to see Jang Uk
to tell him about this thing.

42:23.666 --> 42:26.252
Then I'll go cook his favorite meal then.

42:27.002 --> 42:31.173
Spicy beef soup with lots of vegetables,
especially lots of brackens.

42:31.257 --> 42:32.258
- Don't you dare.
- No, you must not.

42:32.925 --> 42:34.260
[quirky music playing]

42:34.343 --> 42:37.096
Uh, he's probably staying at Jang Uk's
since he went to see him.

42:37.179 --> 42:40.182
Whether beef soup or something else,
Maidservant Kim will

42:40.266 --> 42:43.102
probably cook for him.
So don't cook anything for him, huh?

42:44.228 --> 42:45.271
[chuckles]

42:45.354 --> 42:46.814
That means Maidservant Kim

42:47.982 --> 42:49.400
will have to take…

42:50.526 --> 42:52.194
- care of him?
- [giggles]

42:52.278 --> 42:56.448
They got to be very close when he stayed
at Uk's place last time, isn't that right?

42:56.532 --> 43:00.911
Uh… he even, uh, stopped drinking

43:01.579 --> 43:04.623
chaste herb tea because of her.

43:04.707 --> 43:06.500
- [giggles]
- Is that so?

43:07.167 --> 43:10.087
[Dang-gu stutters]
Then does that mean that Master Lee…

43:10.170 --> 43:13.132
I guess I just know these things, right?

43:13.215 --> 43:15.884
He would even wear
this scarf around his neck

43:15.968 --> 43:18.345
that was a present given to him by her,

43:18.429 --> 43:20.347
even though the floors were heated.

43:20.431 --> 43:21.265
[laughs]

43:21.348 --> 43:23.350
He kept wearing it despite how hot it got?

43:23.434 --> 43:25.269
That sounds like true love to me.

43:25.352 --> 43:26.854
- [Heo Yeom] Yeah.
- [Dang-gu laughs]

43:29.773 --> 43:30.983
[Heo Yeom clears throat]

43:31.567 --> 43:32.401
Uh, look.

43:32.943 --> 43:34.945
It was just a fleeting feeling

43:35.029 --> 43:37.489
he felt for a moment
of his very long life.

43:37.573 --> 43:39.366
Right, Jin, huh?
[laughs]

43:39.450 --> 43:40.492
True love!

43:41.243 --> 43:45.414
If it's his first time in his long life,
it's true, true, true love!

43:45.497 --> 43:46.874
- Enough!
- [Dang-gu grunts]

43:47.541 --> 43:48.917
Ah! True love?

43:51.879 --> 43:53.547
[Jin hums]

43:54.506 --> 43:55.841
I will…

43:56.717 --> 43:58.802
make my beef soup anyways.

44:00.095 --> 44:01.597
So if I'm not feeding him…

44:03.098 --> 44:06.769
how about you two come and have some then?

44:07.895 --> 44:08.771
You too.

44:12.816 --> 44:14.610
- What?
- Oh, you! Are you kidding me?

44:15.110 --> 44:16.612
- [Dang-gu grunts]
- You!

44:27.748 --> 44:28.582
Who is it now?

44:37.716 --> 44:38.550
[exhales]

44:39.093 --> 44:41.136
Jang Uk, it has been a long time.

44:41.220 --> 44:43.889
It's been far too long, Master Lee.

44:45.182 --> 44:48.644
Is there a tower here
for every time you killed a soul shifter?

44:50.145 --> 44:51.689
You've killed quite a few of them then.

44:51.772 --> 44:53.232
Why are you pretending
that you don't know?

44:53.315 --> 44:56.235
You're the one who's been pressuring
the Crown Prince to reward me

44:56.318 --> 44:57.194
for each and every one of them.

44:57.778 --> 44:59.154
Were you hurt that I met with him

44:59.738 --> 45:01.365
but I never took the time
to meet with you?

45:01.448 --> 45:03.534
Well, it's not like
I was really pining for you.

45:05.035 --> 45:07.371
But it's sure really nice
to see you here now.

45:07.454 --> 45:08.705
[scoffs]

45:10.249 --> 45:12.209
Is this one here her stone tower?

45:12.292 --> 45:13.877
You should have taken more care with it.

45:13.961 --> 45:15.963
It's built poorly compared to the others.

45:16.046 --> 45:17.381
I didn't build that one.

45:18.006 --> 45:19.341
Someone destroyed it.

45:20.134 --> 45:21.677
They tried to fix it
but now it looks like that.

45:21.760 --> 45:23.262
Who did? Park Jin?

45:23.345 --> 45:25.389
No, it was Jin Bu-yeon who did it.

45:26.765 --> 45:28.642
Jin Bu-yeon?
Bu-yeon was the one who destroyed it?

45:29.810 --> 45:31.645
[laughs]

45:32.354 --> 45:33.564
Do you know Jin Bu-yeon?

45:35.190 --> 45:36.024
Yes.

45:37.484 --> 45:38.861
I'm the one who saved her life…

45:40.279 --> 45:41.530
and took care of her.

45:50.038 --> 45:52.583
Please don't remain
with Jang Uk any longer.

45:52.666 --> 45:55.043
Mother, I'm already married to Jang Uk.

45:56.211 --> 45:57.379
I won't be returning home.

45:59.840 --> 46:02.593
And why did he choose to marry you?

46:03.510 --> 46:05.929
Is it true that he's after Jinyowon?

46:06.013 --> 46:08.640
No, that's not true.
It's because he needs me.

46:10.726 --> 46:13.103
He's unable to sleep
because of the creatures that flock

46:13.812 --> 46:15.105
to the power of the ice stone.

46:15.856 --> 46:18.984
My divine powers are able
to drive those things away from him.

46:20.736 --> 46:25.282
Are you saying that
you've recovered powers like those?

46:26.617 --> 46:30.454
Yes. It seems like the physician
who treated me was right all along.

46:30.537 --> 46:33.999
I'm regaining my divine powers
as more of my memories return.

46:39.755 --> 46:43.091
Why aren't you asking me anything
after I told you I was her physician?

46:43.967 --> 46:46.470
She already told me all about it,
how she'd been ill,

46:47.012 --> 46:49.431
how she lost her memories,
and how she got locked up.

46:50.432 --> 46:53.852
But I had no idea that you were
the great physician who treated her.

46:55.103 --> 46:58.565
I agreed to keep it a secret
only because her mother begged me.

46:58.649 --> 47:01.735
So then you're telling me
you did absolutely nothing

47:01.818 --> 47:04.696
while she was locked up in a room
and had the tracking thread sewn in her?

47:04.780 --> 47:06.907
I'm sure her mother had
a reason for all of that.

47:07.783 --> 47:10.410
But you, of all people,
completely took the one thing

47:10.953 --> 47:12.871
she had tried so desperately to hide.

47:12.955 --> 47:14.289
Completely!

47:15.541 --> 47:16.458
[scoffs]

47:23.924 --> 47:25.008
[sighs]

47:28.095 --> 47:29.054
Let's go back home.

47:29.137 --> 47:31.431
I promise that I will
let you do whatever you want.

47:31.515 --> 47:35.686
I won't lock you up or force you
to marry someone against your will.

47:36.436 --> 47:39.106
So there won't be any reason
for you to stay here

47:39.189 --> 47:40.524
and let him keep using you.

47:43.277 --> 47:44.528
I promised him that…

47:45.571 --> 47:46.822
I would stay by his side.

47:48.532 --> 47:49.700
So then I see…

47:51.410 --> 47:52.494
you're in love with him.

47:57.499 --> 47:58.417
[clicks tongue]

47:59.334 --> 48:00.294
You poor thing.

48:00.377 --> 48:03.088
It can be extremely painful
to long for someone who will…

48:04.089 --> 48:05.173
never love you back.

48:07.467 --> 48:08.677
End it here, Bu-yeon.

48:09.970 --> 48:10.804
But I don't…

48:11.847 --> 48:13.140
want to end it here with him.

48:15.058 --> 48:17.978
I got married to him
only because I wanted to.

48:19.354 --> 48:20.522
Really?

48:26.403 --> 48:27.863
In that case, very well then.

48:28.864 --> 48:31.533
Bring him over to Jinyowon sometime.

48:33.118 --> 48:34.828
- Why?
- It's the right thing to do

48:34.911 --> 48:36.413
as he's your husband after all.

48:36.496 --> 48:38.457
He should apologize for his actions

48:38.540 --> 48:40.959
and show that he wants to get along.

48:41.585 --> 48:43.337
I'll give him the chance to apologize

48:44.546 --> 48:45.380
so bring him over.

48:46.590 --> 48:50.177
He's not the type to apologize
or make demands from anyone.

48:50.260 --> 48:53.680
If you two insist on this marriage,
it's the least he could do.

48:56.808 --> 48:58.393
I'm giving him a chance…

48:59.519 --> 49:02.522
so be sure you come over together.

49:03.815 --> 49:05.817
[tense music playing]

49:15.661 --> 49:17.621
He'd never go with her, right?

49:18.163 --> 49:19.706
I heard he never comes home.

49:19.790 --> 49:22.584
It's only natural for a man
to visit his in-laws.

49:23.460 --> 49:26.171
But I don't know
if he would ever say sorry.

49:26.254 --> 49:27.297
[sighs]

49:28.131 --> 49:29.383
Young Master Park would have…

49:30.467 --> 49:32.511
gone happily if he got the chance.

49:36.431 --> 49:37.265
[sighs]

49:39.768 --> 49:43.480
I believe this is made to imitate
the fire bird that's kept in Jinyowon.

49:44.147 --> 49:44.981
Fire bird?

49:46.066 --> 49:47.859
The bird they say was born in a volcano?

49:47.943 --> 49:52.072
Right. And the main reason why
Seo Gyeong and Jin Seol-ran

49:52.155 --> 49:55.033
made Jinyowon was to
lock up that bird forever.

49:55.117 --> 49:57.703
Why are you even telling me this then?

49:57.786 --> 50:00.664
Go to Jinyowon and check
if the fire bird is being kept safe.

50:00.747 --> 50:04.000
Only the members of the Jin family
can open the doors into Jinyowon.

50:04.084 --> 50:05.836
Your bride, Jin Bu-yeon could get in.

50:05.919 --> 50:07.421
Yes, but Bu-yeon was kicked out of there.

50:08.296 --> 50:10.841
Don't try to involve me
in things like this.

50:19.641 --> 50:22.394
How would you be able to
summon another ice stone though?

50:22.477 --> 50:25.063
I was told it's possible
by drying out the world.

50:31.319 --> 50:33.155
Even if I didn't force those two,

50:33.864 --> 50:36.700
they're already walking
the same destined path together.

50:40.328 --> 50:43.081
[sighs]
So Uk stays…

50:44.374 --> 50:45.709
[inhales sharply]

50:46.668 --> 50:47.753
Uk stays…

50:48.795 --> 50:51.131
in the room furthest
from the entrance in Jeongjingak.

50:52.007 --> 50:53.675
Although I don't know
if he's there right now.

50:54.843 --> 50:55.969
Should I tag along?

50:57.596 --> 51:00.223
No, thank you. We need to speak privately.

51:09.441 --> 51:10.317
[exhales deeply]

51:19.701 --> 51:22.287
Just say it, Bu-yeon,
like you practiced, okay?

51:29.753 --> 51:32.214
Oh! Ugh! Wait! Hold on.

51:32.798 --> 51:33.632
[Bu-yeon] Don't open this.

51:34.591 --> 51:37.511
Just listen, okay? I have a favor I need.

51:40.305 --> 51:41.139
[sighs]

51:43.642 --> 51:45.393
My mother wants us to go visit her.

51:46.394 --> 51:49.481
She wants you to apologize to her
and try to reconcile.

51:49.564 --> 51:52.567
Do that if you want to keep me
by your side since you need me.

51:54.653 --> 51:57.364
I get that you're rejecting me
after I tried to win your heart.

51:57.447 --> 52:00.116
So my pride also hurts
having to say this to you.

52:01.743 --> 52:02.869
I'll count to three.

52:03.745 --> 52:04.955
And open the door if you'll do it.

52:05.038 --> 52:06.414
If not, just stay there.

52:07.374 --> 52:08.375
And I'll just go away.

52:13.547 --> 52:14.381
So one.

52:16.716 --> 52:17.551
Two.

52:19.886 --> 52:20.720
[whispers]
Please!

52:23.348 --> 52:25.475
[light music playing]

52:30.605 --> 52:31.481
[sighs]

52:32.023 --> 52:34.818
I'm sorry but I couldn't stop you
because you didn't give me a chance to.

52:35.402 --> 52:37.362
I didn't want you to
misunderstand anything

52:37.863 --> 52:39.072
so I had to come outside.

52:40.615 --> 52:42.325
I was told he was in the last room.

52:42.409 --> 52:45.745
Oh, Uk's room
is at the other end of this hallway, yeah.

52:45.829 --> 52:46.830
[sighs]

52:47.372 --> 52:49.040
Took all my courage to say that.

52:50.917 --> 52:52.752
I guess I'll say it again.

52:55.130 --> 52:56.047
I'm sorry.

52:57.591 --> 52:58.466
He's not…

52:59.634 --> 53:01.011
He isn't in here at the moment.

53:01.595 --> 53:02.429
Ah.

53:04.973 --> 53:07.475
How do you think I sound?
Was it too desperate?

53:09.728 --> 53:10.562
Hmm…

53:12.439 --> 53:13.815
It didn't sound desperate.

53:14.524 --> 53:16.359
It sounded much more like a threat to me.

53:16.443 --> 53:17.277
A threat?

53:20.238 --> 53:21.990
I'll have to practice
my groveling a bit more.

53:22.073 --> 53:25.285
Why must you grovel to ask him
to go to your mother's house though?

53:25.368 --> 53:26.328
You're married, aren't you?

53:27.454 --> 53:31.124
We had agreed to turn
a blind eye to our foolishness.

53:31.207 --> 53:32.375
Pretend you heard nothing.

53:32.459 --> 53:34.586
How pathetic do you think I'll feel…

53:36.254 --> 53:37.422
when you ask me something like that?

53:59.569 --> 54:00.862
This is from Maidservant Kim.

54:00.946 --> 54:02.280
Said it's your favorite.

54:07.369 --> 54:08.912
[whimsical music playing]

54:13.166 --> 54:14.376
Can't even say thank you.

54:15.460 --> 54:16.628
Making me beg.

54:18.880 --> 54:19.839
You wouldn't do that, would you?

54:20.590 --> 54:22.550
I bet you never apologized
for anything ever, either.

54:22.634 --> 54:23.468
What now?

54:24.052 --> 54:27.305
You always have some motive
when you say something unexpected.

54:28.807 --> 54:29.641
Listen.

54:31.101 --> 54:33.770
If you're not too busy today,
would you like to…

54:35.021 --> 54:36.856
go to Jinyowon with me?

54:36.940 --> 54:40.068
Is it because Master Lee asked you
to bring me with you to Jinyowon?

54:40.860 --> 54:41.695
What?

54:41.778 --> 54:43.655
I met the physician who had treated you.

54:43.738 --> 54:44.781
That was Master Lee.

54:44.864 --> 54:46.032
Do you know Master Lee as well?

54:46.116 --> 54:49.995
Yes. He told me
to go to Jinyowon with you.

54:50.078 --> 54:51.079
He told you to?

54:54.082 --> 54:55.500
Did Mother talk to him then?

54:55.583 --> 54:58.586
Does your mother want me
to come to Jinyowon as well?

54:58.670 --> 54:59.504
[Bu-yeon] Yes.

55:00.797 --> 55:01.798
Would you come with me?

55:06.011 --> 55:07.679
No, I won't. I don't want to get involved.

55:09.014 --> 55:10.015
Jang Uk!

55:11.182 --> 55:13.518
If I were to grovel for you
a little bit more…

55:15.311 --> 55:16.312
would you come with me then?

55:16.396 --> 55:18.982
I already told Master Lee
that I wouldn't go there either.

55:20.316 --> 55:22.485
So there's no need
for you to keep begging me.

55:26.531 --> 55:27.365
Fine.

55:28.491 --> 55:30.285
I was just trying to stay by your side.

55:32.287 --> 55:33.288
Forget it.

55:34.122 --> 55:35.040
I'll just go.

55:41.588 --> 55:43.548
[somber music playing]

55:47.343 --> 55:48.219
[Bu-yeon sniffles]

56:00.607 --> 56:03.318
[Bu-yeon] Do that if you want to keep me
by your side, since you need me.

56:05.445 --> 56:08.114
I get that you're rejecting me
after I tried to win your heart.

56:08.698 --> 56:11.367
So my pride also hurts
having to say this to you.

56:16.748 --> 56:17.791
[sniffles]

56:32.097 --> 56:32.931
Why would…

56:33.932 --> 56:36.643
she get that upset about me
not going to Jinyowon with her?

56:36.726 --> 56:38.728
Master Lee's the one who should be upset.

56:46.611 --> 56:47.695
[sighs]

56:53.827 --> 56:56.121
Where's Bu-yeon? Did she come home?

56:56.204 --> 56:59.499
She was here for a while,
but she left for Jinyowon.

56:59.582 --> 57:02.335
- Alone?
- She said that you wouldn't go with her.

57:02.418 --> 57:06.381
Even though I offered to go instead,
she declined and went there by herself.

57:06.464 --> 57:08.091
Why would you even offer to go with her?

57:08.174 --> 57:09.968
Just think of how embarrassed
she must have been!

57:10.051 --> 57:11.719
Her mother came all the way here

57:11.803 --> 57:14.848
and invited the two of you over,
offering to forgive it all.

57:14.931 --> 57:17.725
But you just…
you just rejected her right away.

57:18.601 --> 57:21.104
- What?
- I sent her off with so many presents.

57:21.187 --> 57:24.524
But the reality is
she may never even return this time.

57:24.607 --> 57:26.234
Lady Jin told her that she would

57:26.317 --> 57:28.236
set her free
if she denounced the marriage.

57:29.279 --> 57:30.447
I can't…

57:32.323 --> 57:33.241
[sighs]

57:36.035 --> 57:39.706
You chose to come here alone
to see me? Why would you?

57:39.789 --> 57:42.667
It seems as though you mistook the owner
of the eye mask I gave to you.

57:42.750 --> 57:44.377
So I came here to correct your mistake.

57:44.461 --> 57:46.754
In return, I'd like to ask you a favor.

57:46.838 --> 57:49.757
I know you are well aware
that I could kill you for coming here.

57:50.800 --> 57:52.010
But you're here for a favor?

57:53.470 --> 57:55.513
- Let me hear it.
- Before Lord Jin had me

57:55.597 --> 57:58.892
pretend to be your daughter,
he put a blood parasite inside of my body.

57:59.893 --> 58:00.894
Parasite?

58:00.977 --> 58:04.981
So that's how you used to have
the energy of the Jin family within you.

58:05.064 --> 58:07.108
It's settled into the core
of my energy now.

58:08.359 --> 58:09.861
So please tell me how to get rid of it.

58:09.944 --> 58:12.655
How is it possible?
You can't cast spells, can you?

58:13.448 --> 58:14.657
Because if that's the case,

58:14.741 --> 58:17.160
you can't remove it,
at least not before you die.

58:17.243 --> 58:19.579
Lady Jin, please actively
look for a way to do so.

58:20.246 --> 58:22.624
As Jinyowon's leader,
I know you can do anything.

58:22.707 --> 58:23.666
In return,

58:24.501 --> 58:26.377
I promise I'll tell you who…

58:27.420 --> 58:28.546
the real Bu-yeon is.

58:30.507 --> 58:31.382
There's no need.

58:32.050 --> 58:33.551
I've already found my daughter.

58:33.635 --> 58:34.469
Wrong!

58:35.553 --> 58:37.555
That eye mask definitely
belonged to someone else.

58:37.639 --> 58:38.932
Shut your mouth!

58:40.934 --> 58:43.436
Lady Jin. Young Lady Jin has arrived.

58:43.520 --> 58:45.021
- [Ho-gyeong] She's here?
- That's perfect!

58:45.647 --> 58:47.690
I can prove that
it's not Bu-yeon before you.

58:51.444 --> 58:53.488
Lock her up in the annex for now.

58:54.447 --> 58:55.448
Yes.

59:06.251 --> 59:07.752
These are gifts from the Jang family.

59:21.391 --> 59:22.559
So she came here alone.

59:30.400 --> 59:31.651
Mother, I came here to see you.

59:33.570 --> 59:34.779
I came here as well.

59:50.295 --> 59:52.088
Thank you for inviting the two of us over.

59:53.047 --> 59:55.008
I'm sorry I've been acting so rude to you

59:55.592 --> 59:56.718
all this time.

59:56.801 --> 59:58.803
I hope we get along
from this moment forward.

01:00:07.228 --> 01:00:09.522
Well, Mother. We came to see you together.

01:00:11.691 --> 01:00:12.567
[chuckles awkwardly]

01:00:14.777 --> 01:00:16.904
My grandfather asked me
to bring Master Lee

01:00:16.988 --> 01:00:18.781
to Sejukwon if he's here with you.

01:00:18.865 --> 01:00:20.700
Master Lee has returned to Songrim?

01:00:21.576 --> 01:00:23.077
But he hasn't been by the house yet.

01:00:23.161 --> 01:00:25.580
He was supposed
to visit Young Master Jang.

01:00:25.663 --> 01:00:26.497
Ah.

01:00:27.040 --> 01:00:30.752
Our Young Master has gone
with Young Lady Jin over to Jinyowon

01:00:30.835 --> 01:00:32.545
to pay his respects to her mother.

01:00:32.629 --> 01:00:33.504
Oh.

01:00:34.589 --> 01:00:35.423
Is that so?

01:00:36.090 --> 01:00:38.843
I'll make sure to take care
of Master Lee if he comes by.

01:00:38.926 --> 01:00:41.179
No, you can't.
We were told to bring him with us

01:00:41.262 --> 01:00:43.097
as Lord Park needs
to be rescued by Master Lee.

01:00:43.181 --> 01:00:44.932
What happened? Has Lord Park fallen ill?

01:00:45.933 --> 01:00:49.103
Quite ill, in fact,
his spicy beef soup is really good.

01:00:50.355 --> 01:00:51.939
His beef soup tastes good?

01:00:52.940 --> 01:00:54.067
Oh!

01:00:59.614 --> 01:01:00.657
Hmm.

01:01:01.658 --> 01:01:02.492
This is…

01:01:03.576 --> 01:01:04.619
quite tasty.

01:01:11.709 --> 01:01:12.627
Hello, my lord.

01:01:13.378 --> 01:01:14.712
Are you okay in there?

01:01:16.130 --> 01:01:18.299
I have these terrible knots in my stomach.

01:01:19.509 --> 01:01:22.762
I think that I may have indigestion.

01:01:22.845 --> 01:01:24.806
Perhaps we better take you to Sejukwon.

01:01:24.889 --> 01:01:26.265
It's not that bad though.

01:01:27.308 --> 01:01:28.643
But, Maidservant Kim,

01:01:29.477 --> 01:01:31.646
shouldn't you be tending to…

01:01:32.980 --> 01:01:34.440
Master Lee right this moment?

01:01:37.610 --> 01:01:38.444
I mean…

01:01:38.986 --> 01:01:42.740
why would I be tending to him
when you're feeling this ill, my lord?

01:01:42.824 --> 01:01:44.909
I'm certain
he's getting on fine without me.

01:01:45.451 --> 01:01:46.285
Is that so?

01:01:46.369 --> 01:01:48.830
Is there anywhere else
that's bothering you?

01:01:49.414 --> 01:01:51.666
I think I have a headache as well.

01:01:51.749 --> 01:01:53.376
- Oh, goodness. Is that so?
- Mm-hmm.

01:01:53.459 --> 01:01:56.421
Let's see. Let's see.
Oh, I think you've even got a fever.

01:01:56.504 --> 01:01:59.006
- Yeah, sure.
- Should I get a cold towel for you?

01:01:59.841 --> 01:02:00.967
[laughs]

01:02:01.968 --> 01:02:03.678
But you're probably so busy.

01:02:04.846 --> 01:02:07.223
Are you certain you can stay with me?

01:02:07.306 --> 01:02:09.475
But how can I leave when you're sick?

01:02:09.559 --> 01:02:11.686
- I'm staying with you.
- [laughs]

01:02:12.228 --> 01:02:13.354
Thank you so much.

01:02:14.522 --> 01:02:15.982
- Oh. Ow, my stomach.
- Oh, no!

01:02:16.065 --> 01:02:18.359
- Oh, no, my lord! Does your tummy hurt?
- [groans]

01:02:18.443 --> 01:02:19.485
[laughs]

01:02:22.989 --> 01:02:24.490
[doctor Seo] Don't do anything foolish.

01:02:28.453 --> 01:02:30.121
He was causing a scene at the entrance

01:02:30.204 --> 01:02:33.458
and was demanding to speak with you,
so I brought him.

01:02:33.541 --> 01:02:34.417
So what's wrong?

01:02:34.500 --> 01:02:36.252
Please come with me and save our madam.

01:02:36.919 --> 01:02:39.088
She's going to die now all because of you.

01:02:46.262 --> 01:02:49.515
So you're saying
So-i went to Jinyowon to see Lady Jin?

01:02:50.433 --> 01:02:52.769
She left earlier today
but hasn't come back.

01:02:54.395 --> 01:02:57.064
She told me to relay this
if something happened,

01:02:57.565 --> 01:02:58.775
if it seemed like she was in trouble.

01:03:00.026 --> 01:03:01.778
"Lady Jin's real daughter, in fact,

01:03:01.861 --> 01:03:04.655
…was the blind girl
who lived in Sari Village with me."

01:03:05.531 --> 01:03:06.365
Tell him that.

01:03:08.284 --> 01:03:10.161
If I die in Jinyowon, tell him to

01:03:10.828 --> 01:03:13.414
threaten her with my dead body
and that secret

01:03:13.498 --> 01:03:15.416
so he can find some way to stay alive.

01:03:18.002 --> 01:03:19.462
He has to live no matter what.

01:03:25.843 --> 01:03:27.470
The blind girl from Sari Village.

01:03:29.096 --> 01:03:30.348
Is that really what she said?

01:03:34.060 --> 01:03:36.771
[Seo Yul] That girl was
Jin Ho-gyeong's daughter?

01:03:38.064 --> 01:03:40.525
I… I don't know what
she's talking about, but please…

01:03:42.485 --> 01:03:44.403
please help us save our madam.

01:03:46.572 --> 01:03:48.741
How long has it been
since So-i entered Jinyowon?

01:04:00.795 --> 01:04:02.713
[suspenseful music playing]

01:04:16.769 --> 01:04:19.772
The Queen has told me
to trust you and let you help our cause.

01:04:21.107 --> 01:04:23.818
So I'll let you be
a part of the task at hand.

01:04:23.901 --> 01:04:26.362
I'll do my best, my lord,
whatever it may be.

01:04:35.872 --> 01:04:39.709
These are earthenwares,
made from the southern volcano

01:04:39.792 --> 01:04:41.502
and sculpted into a bird.

01:04:41.586 --> 01:04:44.964
A bird born from a volcano?
Are you referring to the fire bird?

01:04:49.927 --> 01:04:52.179
A boat carrying
these precious earthenwares

01:04:52.263 --> 01:04:53.222
must enter here.

01:04:53.723 --> 01:04:56.267
But it won't be easy
without Songrim noticing.

01:04:57.310 --> 01:05:01.606
Use the Seo family's connections
to bring them in safe and sound.

01:05:02.481 --> 01:05:04.650
How hard could it be
bringing in a single boat?

01:05:05.318 --> 01:05:06.360
You can count on me.

01:05:11.824 --> 01:05:13.159
[Dang-gu] Uncle, are you in there?

01:05:13.242 --> 01:05:14.869
I've come to inform you
of something urgent.

01:05:17.580 --> 01:05:18.581
Uncle.

01:05:19.248 --> 01:05:21.334
[Sang-ho]
Lord Park! Please come out, my lord.

01:05:23.502 --> 01:05:26.505
- My lord. Please, my lord. My lord!
- [moans, gasps]

01:05:27.381 --> 01:05:28.507
Shh!

01:05:28.591 --> 01:05:30.593
- What's wrong?
- I think there's someone outside.

01:05:30.676 --> 01:05:32.470
Huh? Who?

01:05:33.763 --> 01:05:34.931
Who's there? Oh, goodness.

01:05:35.514 --> 01:05:36.515
[moans]

01:05:43.481 --> 01:05:44.482
There's a lot out there.

01:05:44.565 --> 01:05:46.192
- [gasps]
- What could it be?

01:05:46.275 --> 01:05:48.653
- [Maid Kim exhales] No, wait!
- [groans]

01:05:49.320 --> 01:05:51.238
I'm here! What about me though?

01:05:51.322 --> 01:05:53.783
What would they think if they saw me here,

01:05:53.866 --> 01:05:55.493
this late at night with you?

01:05:56.160 --> 01:05:57.870
[both gasp]

01:05:57.954 --> 01:06:01.123
Oh, no! What do we do?
What do we do? Oh, no!

01:06:02.667 --> 01:06:03.584
[Maid Kim groans]

01:06:07.046 --> 01:06:08.965
[Dang-gu] Uncle, I'm coming in now.
[grunts]

01:06:10.132 --> 01:06:11.342
What?

01:06:12.301 --> 01:06:13.302
What's wrong?

01:06:16.806 --> 01:06:17.848
Oh.

01:06:19.266 --> 01:06:21.978
Never mind, we'll go back
for now, my lord.

01:06:22.061 --> 01:06:23.771
[whimsical music playing]

01:06:24.522 --> 01:06:25.356
[Dang-gu] Let's go!

01:06:28.401 --> 01:06:30.486
Oh, no! They know!
[gasps]

01:06:31.904 --> 01:06:33.239
They must have caught on.

01:06:33.322 --> 01:06:35.700
Maybe we should've just
gone out and greeted them.

01:06:36.450 --> 01:06:38.577
What do I do? I'm so embarrassed.

01:06:39.829 --> 01:06:41.372
- [laughs]
- How can you be laughing

01:06:41.455 --> 01:06:42.373
in this situation?

01:06:42.957 --> 01:06:44.041
You're just so pretty.

01:06:44.125 --> 01:06:48.004
Your shyness right now reminds me
of an adolescent girl.

01:06:49.213 --> 01:06:50.047
Oh.

01:06:51.257 --> 01:06:53.300
Thanks to you, I also feel like

01:06:53.384 --> 01:06:58.431
an adolescent boy who's been caught
sneaking around with his date.

01:07:00.808 --> 01:07:02.560
It's really nice to hear that you feel…

01:07:03.853 --> 01:07:04.770
youthful around me.

01:07:06.522 --> 01:07:07.356
Let us…

01:07:09.066 --> 01:07:11.318
spend our lives together.

01:07:27.209 --> 01:07:28.753
I, Park Jin of Songrim,

01:07:29.670 --> 01:07:31.672
ask Kim Yeon from Wol Fortress,

01:07:33.132 --> 01:07:37.261
to please take my hand in marriage.

01:07:42.725 --> 01:07:43.559
I,

01:07:44.810 --> 01:07:46.145
Kim Yeon of Wol Fortress,

01:07:48.314 --> 01:07:49.940
accept Park Jin of Songrim's…

01:07:51.525 --> 01:07:52.902
proposal to marry me.

01:07:57.865 --> 01:08:00.117
[Sang-ho] Lord Park! Congratulations!

01:08:00.201 --> 01:08:01.869
- [men] Congratulations!
- [both chuckle]

01:08:02.870 --> 01:08:04.413
I guess they never left.

01:08:04.497 --> 01:08:06.540
I guess they did not go.

01:08:06.624 --> 01:08:10.461
- Congratulations! Congrats!
- [laughter]

01:08:10.544 --> 01:08:12.129
- [man] I never thought this would happen!
- [Dang-gu sobs]

01:08:12.213 --> 01:08:14.507
- [Sang-ho] Congrats you two!
- [Dang-gu] Congratulations!

01:08:15.591 --> 01:08:17.760
- [men] Congratulations!
- [chuckles]

01:08:19.804 --> 01:08:20.638
[Maid Kim] Oh, my…

01:08:22.181 --> 01:08:24.183
[romantic music playing]

01:08:30.189 --> 01:08:32.024
[loud smooching]

01:08:35.361 --> 01:08:36.320
[Maid Kim exhales deeply]

01:08:40.866 --> 01:08:43.035
Thank you for welcoming us with open arms

01:08:43.119 --> 01:08:44.703
even though you weren't
happy with our union.

01:08:44.787 --> 01:08:46.872
Well, I did invite you here after all.

01:08:48.082 --> 01:08:49.333
- All right, then.
- All right, then…

01:08:50.626 --> 01:08:52.211
Lady Jin, would you please
show us to our room?

01:08:54.713 --> 01:08:57.675
You want to spend
the night here in Jinyowon?

01:08:58.342 --> 01:09:00.636
This is our first time visiting
since getting married,

01:09:00.719 --> 01:09:02.346
so it's important
that we fulfill our duties.

01:09:02.429 --> 01:09:05.224
If we return now, I'll get
an earful from Maidservant Kim.

01:09:05.808 --> 01:09:09.228
That's true. It's only right
that you two spend the night.

01:09:11.397 --> 01:09:14.567
But I haven't prepared a room
for you both to stay in tonight.

01:09:14.650 --> 01:09:17.111
As we're here to fulfill our duties,
it doesn't matter where we stay.

01:09:17.194 --> 01:09:20.447
We'd happily take
even that room she was locked in.

01:09:20.531 --> 01:09:21.657
We'll spend the night in there.

01:09:22.533 --> 01:09:24.326
Oh, not there. How can I let you?

01:09:24.410 --> 01:09:27.288
I will quickly prepare
a room for you both.

01:09:27.913 --> 01:09:29.373
[Jang Uk] Would you for us?

01:09:29.456 --> 01:09:31.667
Although it shouldn't be too hard…

01:09:32.543 --> 01:09:33.919
in this spacious abode.

01:09:34.003 --> 01:09:34.962
[Jang Uk chuckles]

01:09:38.883 --> 01:09:41.051
[quirky music playing]

01:09:59.904 --> 01:10:01.864
[Bu-yeon] I'm grateful that you came with.

01:10:03.991 --> 01:10:05.743
But there was no need
for us to stay the night.

01:10:07.453 --> 01:10:08.287
We do.

01:10:08.996 --> 01:10:10.581
That is part of the reason
why I came here.

01:10:11.999 --> 01:10:13.709
You want us to spend
our first night together here?

01:10:15.169 --> 01:10:17.171
All I said is that I wanted
to spend the night here.

01:10:17.922 --> 01:10:19.506
Why would you think
we're doing it tonight?

01:10:20.716 --> 01:10:21.592
How could I not?

01:10:21.675 --> 01:10:23.177
It's supposed to be
our first married visit.

01:10:23.260 --> 01:10:25.346
There's alcohol and
a newlyweds' bed here too.

01:10:26.055 --> 01:10:27.473
It's only natural for me to assume

01:10:27.556 --> 01:10:29.058
you're here to spend
our first night together.

01:10:29.141 --> 01:10:32.937
I'm sorry if I disappointed you,
but I have something I need to do first.

01:10:33.646 --> 01:10:35.231
Master Lee asked me for a favor.

01:10:37.149 --> 01:10:40.027
For what? That you would
come to Jinyowon with me?

01:10:41.362 --> 01:10:42.196
Yes.

01:10:42.279 --> 01:10:44.573
Earlier, we seemed to have
misunderstood each other.

01:10:45.366 --> 01:10:47.159
I've done everything you've asked for.

01:10:47.243 --> 01:10:50.371
Now, we must go do what I need to do.

01:10:51.038 --> 01:10:51.872
What's that?

01:10:53.749 --> 01:10:57.002
Tonight, I'm gonna need you to
open the door to Jinyowon for me.

01:10:58.170 --> 01:10:59.964
[Go Won] What is it
that you seek from Jinyowon?

01:11:00.881 --> 01:11:02.967
If it's an artifact
for the rite of the lake,

01:11:03.050 --> 01:11:05.427
you should be able to
formally request it from Lady Jin.

01:11:05.511 --> 01:11:06.470
That item…

01:11:07.721 --> 01:11:09.932
is something not even Lady Jin can touch.

01:11:10.599 --> 01:11:13.519
Jinyowon will crumble
if it is taken out of there.

01:11:13.602 --> 01:11:14.979
Jin Mu, are you after…

01:11:16.939 --> 01:11:18.023
the great fire bird by chance?

01:11:20.150 --> 01:11:20.985
That's right.

01:11:22.361 --> 01:11:25.155
It's something that can
only be gained by ruling Jinyowon.

01:11:25.239 --> 01:11:27.825
So the lake rite that
Cheonbugwan has been preparing for…

01:11:28.909 --> 01:11:31.161
was not actually the rain
like I thought before.

01:11:33.580 --> 01:11:35.332
Are you looking for the ice stone again?

01:11:36.000 --> 01:11:40.504
Had I not agreed to share
all my powers with you, Your Highness?

01:11:40.587 --> 01:11:42.923
- That agreement ended three years ago.
- No, it didn't.

01:11:43.007 --> 01:11:45.718
And you could have killed me
and put an end to all of this.

01:11:45.801 --> 01:11:48.304
You spared me. So from then on…

01:11:49.888 --> 01:11:53.809
you and I have always been
working together, so when did it end?

01:11:53.892 --> 01:11:54.852
If that's the case…

01:11:58.355 --> 01:11:59.398
let me end it right now.

01:12:02.818 --> 01:12:03.986
You must also stop this.

01:12:04.069 --> 01:12:05.904
If you truly wish for me to stop,

01:12:05.988 --> 01:12:08.866
just go to Jang Uk
and tell him the truth about everything.

01:12:08.949 --> 01:12:12.870
"Jang Uk, I manipulated and killed Naksu
in order for me to beat you."

01:12:12.953 --> 01:12:16.332
And I, Jin Mu,
did that solely for you, Sire.

01:12:18.751 --> 01:12:21.754
If you can't tell Jang Uk the truth
about the nature of your actions…

01:12:23.589 --> 01:12:25.174
you won't end this.

01:12:33.432 --> 01:12:35.434
[tense music playing]

01:12:43.609 --> 01:12:44.651
[scoffs]

01:12:45.569 --> 01:12:47.529
[So-i groans]

01:12:47.613 --> 01:12:49.073
[So-i] I had no idea…

01:12:50.240 --> 01:12:52.618
that you already knew
who your real daughter was.

01:12:55.120 --> 01:12:57.498
And that she's been alive by your side.

01:12:58.457 --> 01:13:01.585
Who else knows the truth
about my daughter? Give me their names.

01:13:03.796 --> 01:13:04.755
Answer me.

01:13:06.673 --> 01:13:07.800
Does Jin Mu know?

01:13:08.717 --> 01:13:09.676
Someone from Songrim?

01:13:15.224 --> 01:13:18.143
If you're so curious,
go and ask them yourself.

01:13:18.227 --> 01:13:20.771
Ask them if they know that Jin Bu-yeon

01:13:20.854 --> 01:13:23.607
that you fished
out of Lake Gyeongcheondaeho…

01:13:25.692 --> 01:13:27.152
was actually…

01:13:28.612 --> 01:13:29.446
Naksu.

01:13:29.530 --> 01:13:31.990
[So-i laughs]

01:13:42.793 --> 01:13:43.627
Hey.

01:13:44.253 --> 01:13:45.921
You can open the doors, can't you?

01:13:46.004 --> 01:13:47.297
[Bu-yeon] Of course I can.

01:13:47.965 --> 01:13:50.968
That was the first thing that
my mother asked me to do when I woke up.

01:13:52.511 --> 01:13:53.345
But, uh…

01:13:54.430 --> 01:13:55.556
what do you need to do in there?

01:13:56.974 --> 01:13:59.601
I just need to see if the object
Master Lee mentioned is still in there.

01:14:00.185 --> 01:14:02.604
Don't worry, I'm not trying
to use you to help me steal anything.

01:14:03.981 --> 01:14:04.815
[gasps]

01:14:21.832 --> 01:14:23.167
People were walking by.

01:14:24.334 --> 01:14:26.670
I wasn't making a move. Don't worry.

01:14:26.753 --> 01:14:28.088
We are guests here.

01:14:28.589 --> 01:14:30.841
All we have to do is say
we're taking a walk.

01:14:30.924 --> 01:14:31.758
Oh.

01:14:32.885 --> 01:14:33.719
You're right.

01:14:34.720 --> 01:14:35.554
[Bu-yeon chuckles]

01:14:36.388 --> 01:14:38.390
It's my habit to hide.

01:14:40.767 --> 01:14:43.395
Were you not allowed to even walk
through the gardens

01:14:43.479 --> 01:14:45.647
- when you were locked up?
- No.

01:14:46.315 --> 01:14:47.316
[sighs]

01:14:47.399 --> 01:14:48.859
I really felt like I was…

01:14:49.735 --> 01:14:51.153
suffocating in that room.

01:14:52.362 --> 01:14:55.782
I often imagined myself standing alone
on top of a very tall tree.

01:14:56.783 --> 01:15:00.412
I knew no one
and I felt so helpless with no one around.

01:15:02.831 --> 01:15:04.625
I was hoping
someone would come and rescue me.

01:15:07.169 --> 01:15:08.253
And then you came.

01:15:12.007 --> 01:15:12.841
What?

01:15:14.968 --> 01:15:16.220
What are you talking about?

01:15:18.847 --> 01:15:20.849
It's just my fantasy.

01:15:22.893 --> 01:15:25.604
I told you there was something
I kept thinking about in that room.

01:15:26.730 --> 01:15:28.815
I promise you I don't have that stone!

01:15:56.760 --> 01:15:58.762
[soft music playing]

01:16:06.895 --> 01:16:07.896
I must have…

01:16:10.732 --> 01:16:12.067
gone crazy because of you.

01:16:18.824 --> 01:16:20.993
["I′m Sorry" by Ailee playing]

01:17:04.703 --> 01:17:07.623
ALCHEMY OF SOULS
PART 2

01:17:08.123 --> 01:17:10.042
Someone just entered from over there.

01:17:10.125 --> 01:17:12.044
So-i, So-i, do you recognize me?

01:17:12.127 --> 01:17:14.963
[Go Won] Why do you say that?
Has your husband not come back yet?

01:17:15.047 --> 01:17:17.257
Leaving you alone like that
means it's over.

01:17:17.341 --> 01:17:18.216
Not now.

01:17:18.300 --> 01:17:19.176
[Bu-yeon] I'm also going to stay.

01:17:20.218 --> 01:17:22.346
[Bu-yeon] I plan to find my own room

01:17:22.429 --> 01:17:25.432
so that you don't get confused anymore.

01:17:25.515 --> 01:17:27.517
[Seo Yul] Because if you're right,
it means all my pain

01:17:27.601 --> 01:17:29.186
is because I kept this.

01:17:29.269 --> 01:17:30.646
[mages shout]

01:17:31.271 --> 01:17:34.858
[Yeom-su] So So-i's parasite
is inside Seo Yul's body.
